Work with YouTrack issues

Usage:
  ytrack issue <command> [flags]
  ytrack issue [command]

Available Commands:
  command     Apply a YouTrack command to one or more issues
  comment     Add a comment to an issue
  create      Create an issue
  edit        Edit an issue
  list        List issues
  view        Show an issue

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for issue

Global Flags:
      --debug       Log HTTP requests to stderr with credentials redacted
      --host host   YouTrack host or service URL to use
      --no-color    Disable color output

Use "ytrack issue [command] --help" for more information about a command.
